Handaxe</a>)\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Homing_Weapon\" title=\"Homing Weapon\">Homing Weapon</a>, but deals damage to wielder on return\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dwarven_Thrower\" title=\"Dwarven Thrower\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Dwarven_Thrower\" title=\"Dwarven Thrower\"> <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Dwarven Thrower</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/50px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\">Main Hand Melee</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Warhammers\" title=\"Warhammers\">Warhammer</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Homing_Weapon\" title=\"Homing Weapon\">Homing Weapon</a></dt><dd>This weapon will return to its owner when thrown.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nyrulna\" title=\"Nyrulna\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Nyrulna_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Nyrulna\" title=\"Nyrulna\"> <span style=\"color: #B7861D ;\">Nyrulna</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/50px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\">Main Hand Melee</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Tridents\" title=\"Tridents\">Trident</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Zephyr_Connection\" title=\"Zephyr Connection\">Zephyr Connection</a></dt><dd>This weapon will return to your hand when thrown. You cannot be forced to drop the trident. When thrown, the weapon creates an explosion that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">3d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage in a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.p